    "shear_heating": "Viscous dissipation (剪断発熱) uses specific_heat_J_kgK and density_melt_kgm3 to convert volumetric power η·γ̇² [W/m³] into a temperature rise rate. Thermal conductivity is derived as k = α·ρ·cp [W/(m·K)] for the Brinkman number.",
